                    "notes": "This item allows you to consistently generate ultimate charge by deflecting enemy abilities especially Reinhardt\u2019s Fire Strike. The higher your Ability Power, the faster your ultimate will charge, as long as your deflect hits enemies. Try to anticipate when Reinhardt is about to throw his Fire Strike; if it\u2019s difficult to land, draw the fight into a tight space where he\u2019s more likely to cast. Once he does, reflect it back that\u2019s your cue to go aggressive and lead the push.",
