            "notes": "By Round 5, you should be able to buy all these item provides additional cooldown reduction and helps you sustain incoming damage by letting you cycle your abilities more frequently. This makes it harder for Reinhardt to land a Charge, Junker Queen to pull you with her Jagged Blade, or Ana to land a Sleep Dart or Biotic Grenade. \nWith all that cooldown reduction, you\u2019ll maintain pressure while denying their key abilities, making you much harder to shut down.\nHowever, this doesn\u2019t mean you can charge recklessly into the enemy line you can still be punished if you're careless. Instead, focus on timing your engagements carefully, and wait for someone on the enemy team to make a mistake. That\u2019s your moment to strike with confidence and control.",
